<title>USA: Hedstrom says extends tender offer for ERO.</title>
<headline>Hedstrom says extends tender offer for ERO.</headline>
<dateline>CORAOPOLIS, Pa. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hedstrom Corp said its wholly owned subsidiary, HC Acquisition Corp, has extended its tender offer for all of the issued and outstanding shares of common stock of ERO Inc.</p>
<p>The tender offer, which remains at a price of $11.25 per share, is now set to expire midnight EDT on June 11. Initially, the offer was scheduled to expire at midnight EDT on June 2.</p>
<p>The acquisition is worth an estimated $203 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
